# Manual QA checklist maintenance

When you change player-facing gameplay, content, or run flow in this project, update [`docs/manual_qa_checklist.md`](docs/manual_qa_checklist.md) in the same change set.

## Update when you
- Add/change architecture, economy, special (Q), HUD resource bars
- Add/change statuses, synergies, craft recipes, loot parts
- Change ActRoute / biomes / room flow / win-reward timing
- Add/change enemies, behaviors, traps, drones, or spawn rules
- Change restart/death/overlay pause behavior

## How to update
- Add new checklist items for new verifiable behavior
- Edit or remove items that no longer match the game
- Keep items actionable and manual-test oriented (no implementation details)
- Do not invent unchecked marketing fluff — only what a playtester can verify

## Do not skip
Shipping a feature/content PR without touching the checklist when behavior changed is a miss — amend the checklist before finishing.
